WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.180
- [Gavin] Hello there, I'm Gav.

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:02.660
Welcome to this Slow Mo Guys video.

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.690
Now, a Taser being fired
is a highly requested,

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.940
that's me waving like an
idiot, highly requested video,

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:10.460
but could never get a hold of
one, so I flew to Scottsdale

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:14.070
in Arizona to Taser HQ
to fire some tasers.

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.900
This is the cartridge we're
using, it's for the X26 model.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.690
It's a one-shot cartridge.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:21.560
And we're gonna be using the V25-11,

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:23.520
which is an extremely fast camera,

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.300
because Tasers are extremely fast.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.133
- I'll give you a countdown.

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:26.966
- [Gavin] Okay.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.713
- Three, two, one!

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.580
- This was recorded at
1000 frames a second,

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:38.030
and as you can see, still way too fast.

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:43.030
So the V25-11 will shoot
28,500 frames a second in HD.

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:45.370
As you can see, the
penetration of the prongs

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:46.720
is pretty solid.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.190
You want to aim sort of
to split the belt line,

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:50.700
that's where they usually
aim, so one above,

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:51.700
one bellow the belt.

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.580
So here's a close-up shot
at 28,500 frames a second

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:55.880
of a Taser being deployed.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:17.790
And now we're gonna get a front-on shot

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:19.610
of the taser being fired.

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:20.810
- [Man] Three, two, one!

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.680
So you're probably wondering a this point,

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:32.080
what's up with the confetti?

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:35.230
These are actually known as the aphids.

00:01:35.230 --> 00:01:38.440
It's a good way of tracking
which Taser has been deployed,

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:42.270
who fired it, because each
tiny piece of confetti

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:44.910
has the serial number of
the cartridge that fired it.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:47.010
Very clever, 'cause you
could never pick them all up.

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:48.970
So Dan's not here today, but luckily,

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:50.670
we've got someone else called Dan.

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:52.770
- Fill-in Dan.

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:54.800
- [Gavin] What do you do for a living?

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:57.020
- I play with these cameras a lot.

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:59.610
- [Gavin] And somehow you've
been roped into getting...

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:01.250
- Yep.
- Exposed with a taser

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:02.330
in a Slow Mo Guys video.

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:05.600
- Apparently they feel like,
y'know, I need some payback

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.930
for bringing cameras
to these guys at Taser.

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:09.170
- [Man] Okay, Dan, I want you to relax

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:13.527
in five, four, three, two, one.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:29.960
- Feels like it's never gonna end!

00:02:30.937 --> 00:02:32.128
- Good job, man.

00:02:32.128 --> 00:02:32.977
- [Gavin] That was five seconds!

00:02:32.977 --> 00:02:34.990
- Felt like a long freakin' five seconds.

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:26.840
- [Gavin] If I speed
up this shot slightly,

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.070
you can see that, from the
point of impact, his muscles

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:31.600
contract from right to
left across the shoulders.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:32.433
Look at that.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:00.513
Dan, thoughts?

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.320
Would you do that again?

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:05.737
- Would I do it again?

00:04:05.737 --> 00:04:06.737
- [Gavin] Yeah, if you had to.

00:04:06.737 --> 00:04:09.951
- You'd owe me a lot of
money if I did that again.

00:04:09.951 --> 00:04:12.370
Someone would be paying some heavy price.

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:14.950
- [Gavin] Ah, that is fully in there.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:16.550
Do you feel it in you right now?

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:18.470
- I don't really feel the probes.

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:22.240
I feel like, y'know, it still feels like

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.633
my muscles are locked up
is what it feels like.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:27.280
- [Gavin] How's the stomach contents?

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:28.774
Did it all remain where it was?

00:04:28.774 --> 00:04:30.064
- [Dan] Yeah, it stays in.

00:04:30.064 --> 00:04:30.943
I have not wet my pants.

00:04:31.962 --> 00:04:32.795
Life is good.

00:04:32.795 --> 00:04:33.628
- [Gavin] Was the noise involuntary?

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.784
- That was just comin' out,

00:04:36.784 --> 00:04:38.514
I couldn't stop that from comin' out.

00:04:38.514 --> 00:04:40.350
I think that was more of my body just...

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:44.050
I think that was more of
just my body convulsing

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:44.883
and pushing the--

00:04:44.883 --> 00:04:46.841
- [Gavin] It was pretty manly, though.

00:04:46.841 --> 00:04:47.910
- Did it sound pretty manly?

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:49.270
- Yeah, it was like--
- Kinda brave-hearted?

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:52.859
- [Gavin] It wasn't like,

00:04:54.136 --> 00:04:54.969
- Oh man!

00:04:56.540 --> 00:05:00.840
Look at that ripple going
through the back, jeez!

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:01.980
- [Gavin] So we're keeping the trend alive

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.993
of torturing people named Dan.

00:05:05.042 --> 00:05:07.860
- If Dan's not here, I guess
a second Dan's always willing

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:09.120
to step up to the plate.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:10.150
- [Gavin] I hope you enjoyed that video.

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:13.140
Thanks to Taser for letting
me come to film at their HQ.

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:14.580
You can buy a shirt if you want.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.390
And this is a pretty gross shot

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:17.750
of the prong being pulled out.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.960
They're barbed so they
don't bounce out on impact,

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:23.993
so to get 'em out, you need
to give 'em a nice little tug.

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:32.620
Speaking of Tasers, there is
a Taser in the super awesome

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.700
upcoming movie Lazer Team.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:36.650
I'm in it, it comes out in Winter.

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:39.050
Here's some of the trailer,
thanks for watching.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.380
- Why the hell are we Lazer Team, anyway?

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:43.310
- Because I have a laser.

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:44.520
- Yeah, but the rest of us don't!

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.570
- Right, you're the team part!

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.470
- Nobody cares about your stupid name!

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.600
- The helmet heightens
all mental functions

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:00.671
and other visual enhancements.

00:06:00.671 --> 00:06:01.504
- Guys!

00:06:01.504 --> 00:06:02.707
- The hell is your problem?

00:06:02.707 --> 00:06:07.207
- Turn it off, turn it off,
oh god, I wish I was dead!

